e system-dividers element indicates the presence or absence of system dividers (also known as system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"separation marks) between systems displayed on the same page. Dividers on the left and right side of the page"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are controlled by the left-divider and right-divider elements respectively. The default vertical position is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"half the system-distance value from the top of the system that is below the divider. The default horizontal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position is the left and right system margin, respectively."}]}}}